    {
      "file": "src/ua_types_encoding_binary.c",
      "function": "ExtensionObject_decodeBinaryContent",
      "line": null,
      "code": "dst->content.encoded.typeId = *typeId;",
      "note": "Root cause. In the unknown-type `ExtensionObject` path, the decoded `NodeId` is shallow-copied into the destination instead of being duplicated or ownership-transferred. `ExtensionObject_decodeBinary()` later frees `binTypeId`, so `dst->content.encoded.typeId` becomes a dangling alias. The fix replaces this assignment with `UA_NodeId_copy(typeId, &dst->content.encoded.typeId);`.",
      "kind": "root_cause_function"
    },
